From: Elara <elara@portal.local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:36:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ui: the network mode carries hidden gestures
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

'Сеть порталов' is its own control now: a Material-looking segment that answers a
double tap with the filter editor (reorder, hide) and a long press with the classic
proxies dashboard. Filter order and the hidden set live in a provider and are applied
wherever the group list is built.
---
